  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[C#m] [Eb] [Ab] [C#m] [F] [Bb] (x2)\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[C#m]This broken wheel is coming undone\nAnd the roads exploding\nBut you're keeping me strong\nRolling along with you\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[C#m] [F]Love is a tower\n[Bb] [C] [Eb]And you're the key\n[Ab] [C] [F]Leading me higher\n[Bb] [Cm] [Eb] [Ab] [Cm]When you let me in\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[F] [Cm] [F] [Cm]Keeping us close, so close\n[Cm]On down the line\nSometimes I burn like a dot on the sun\nWith no one knowing\nBut you're keeping me strong\nRolling along with you\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[C#m] [F]You are a tower of\n[Bb] [Cm] [Eb]Strength to me\n[Ab] [Cm] [F]The darkening hour\n[Bb] [Cm] [Eb] [Ab]Sees light again\n[Cm] [F] [Bb]Again\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[Cm] [Eb] [Ab] [F] [Cm] [Eb] [Ab] [F] [Bb] [C]\nYou are, you are, you are, you are, you are\n[Eb] [Ab] [F] [Cm] [Eb] [Ab] [F] [Bb]\nYou are, you are, you are, you are,\n\n{section: Interlúdio}\n[Cm] [Eb]\n[Cm]\n\n{section: Outro}\n[Cm] [F] [Eb]Love is a tower\n[Ab] [Cm] [F]Of strength to me\n[Bb] [Cm] [Eb]I am the shoreline\n[Ab] [Cm] [F] [Bb]But you're the sea\n[Cm] [Eb] [Ab] [Cm] [F] [Bb]The sea\n[Cm] [Eb] [Ab]You are,\n[Cm] [F] [Bb] [Cm] [Eb] [Cm]You are."
